    "body": "## Parent\n\n#172\n\n## What to build\n\nDeliver the route-backed `/meetings/weekly` tab, Sunday-to-Saturday Workspace-timezone boundaries, Completed, In progress, and Upcoming Meeting groups, cancelled exclusion, honest missing-artifact states, and separate overdue, due-this-week, and pending-Action-Item sections.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] Today and This week are directly navigable route-backed Meeting Wizard tabs and survive refresh and browser navigation.\n- [ ] This week covers Sunday through Saturday in the Workspace timezone.\n- [ ] Meetings classify correctly as Completed, In progress, or Upcoming at exact start and end boundaries; cancelled Meetings are excluded.\n- [ ] A Meeting remains visible when its expected Brief or Debrief is unavailable, preparing, or failed.\n- [ ] The latest successful Brief or Debrief is selected instead of a newer failed Run.\n- [ ] Overdue Tasks, open Tasks due through Saturday, and pending Action Items appear as separate deterministic sections.\n- [ ] Task and Action Item changes update deterministic sections immediately.\n- [ ] `npm run check` is green.\n\n## Blocked by\n\n- #174 — Edit Task details and organize Task Lists\n- #179 — Dismiss, restore, and regenerate Action Items safely\n- #192 — Show canonical Tasks and Action Items on Home and Daily Briefing\n- #193 — Promote the clean Meeting Wizard Today experience",
